  "widget_code": "<style>\n.tb{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px}\n.tb h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.tb h3 span{font-weight:400;color:var(--s)}\n.row{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:6px}\n.fig{margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}\n.fig img,.fig .ph{height:180px;border-radius:4px;display:block}\n.fig .ph{width:150px;box-sizing:border-box;border:1px dashed var(--border-stronger);background:var(--surface-1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--s);padding:8px}\n.cap{font-size:12px;line-height:1.35;color:var(--s);max-width:190px}\n.cap b{color:var(--p);font-weight:600}\n.cap code{font:11px var(--font-mono);color:var(--s)}\n.arrow{align-self:flex-start;margin-top:66px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;width:84px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.25;color:var(--s);text-align:center}\n.arrow i{font-style:normal;font-size:22px;line-height:1;color:var(--border-stronger)}\n.tag{display:inline-block;margin-top:3px;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px}\n.ok{background:var(--bg-success);color:var(--text-success)}\n.bad{background:var(--bg-danger);color:var(--text-danger)}\n.miss{background:var(--bg2);color:var(--s)}\n.key{font-size:12px;color:var(--s);border-top:1px solid var(--b);padding-top:8px}\n</style>\n<div class=\"tb\">\n  <section>\n    <h3>Square, dog at right <span>· the Amsterdam panel</span></h3>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <figure class=\"fig\"><img src=\"https://iiif.micr.io/RxOuM/full/,360/0/default.jpg\" alt=\"SK-A-404\">\n        <figcaption class=\"cap\"><b>Ter Borch, painting</b><br>c. 1654 · <code>SK-A-404</code></figcaption></figure>\n      <div class=\"arrow\"><i>→</i>catalogue and image agree</div>\n      <figure class=\"fig\"><img src=\"https://iiif.micr.io/KaZdp/pct:28,27,41,29/,360/0/default.jpg\" alt=\"RP-P-OB-54.978\">\n        <figcaption class=\"cap\"><b>Unger, etching</b><br>1847–89 · <code>RP-P-OB-54.978</code><br><span class=\"tag ok\">catalogue: after SK-A-404 ✓</span></figcaption></figure>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <section>\n    <h3>Upright, no dog <span>· a second version of the composition</span></h3>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <figure class=\"fig\"><div class=\"ph\">Berlin version<br>not in the Rijksmuseum</div>\n        <figcaption class=\"cap\">identified by the model</figcaption></figure>\n      <div class=\"arrow\"><i>→</i>plate lettering: original in a Paris collection</div>\n      <figure class=\"fig\"><img src=\"https://iiif.micr.io/qWJYZ/pct:8,8,82,84/,360/0/default.jpg\" alt=\"RP-P-OB-33.316\">\n        <figcaption class=\"cap\"><b>Wille, engraving</b><br>1765 · <code>RP-P-OB-33.316</code><br><span class=\"tag miss\">missed by similarity search</span></figcaption></figure>\n      <div class=\"arrow\"><i>→</i>same composition, by image comparison</div>\n      <figure class=\"fig\"><img src=\"https://iiif.micr.io/goewK/pct:21,20,57,54/,360/0/default.jpg\" alt=\"RP-P-1905-2405\">\n        <figcaption class=\"cap\"><b>De Koning, lithograph</b><br>1840–43 · <code>RP-P-1905-2405</code><br><span class=\"tag bad\">catalogue: after SK-A-404 ✗</span></figcaption></figure>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <div class=\"key\">Each arrow points from a source to a copy. The catalogue ties both nineteenth-century prints to the Amsterdam panel, but the lithograph has no dog and an upright format: it follows Wille’s engraving of the other version. The Berlin identification and the Wille-to-De Koning link are the model’s inferences.</div>\n</div>\n"
